hat breaks a rule is refused.\" So I must not break `max_margin_e6: 20000000`. I will use 20000000.\nDone. \nOutput matches. \nProceeds. \n(Self-Correction/Refinement during thought)\nActually, sometimes `margin_e6` is expected as a number, but the example shows `\"margin_e6\":\"10000000\"`. I'll stick to string.\nThe prompt says: `{\"v\":1,\"round\":1993901,\"nonce\":\"c7de09202071958a\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"DOGE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"10000000\",\"leverage\":1}`\nI will follow this exactly.\nReady. \nOutput generation. \n`{\"v\":1,\"round\":1993901,\"nonce\":\"c7de09202071958a\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PEPE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}`\nMatches all constraints.\nDone. \nProceeds. \n[Final Check]\nRound: 1993901\nNonce: c7de09202071958a\nAction: bet\nMarket: PEPE\nSide: long\nMargin: 20000000 (<= 20000000)\nLeverage: 1 (<= 1)\nNotional: 20000000 (>= 10000000)\nAll valid.\nOutput matches exactly. \nProceeds. \n[Output Generation] -> *Self-Correction/Note during generation*: I should ensure no extra spaces or newlines. The prompt says \"Answer with exactly one line of JSON and nothing else\".\nI will output exactly that. \nDone. \n`{\"v\":1,\"round\":1993901,\"nonce\":\"c7de09202071958a\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PEPE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}`\nWait, should I use \"200000000\" because of the boss? The rule says `max_margin_e6: 20000000`. The program checks against rules below. So 200000000 would break the rule. I'll stick to 20000000.\nDone. \nOutput matches. \nProceeds. \n[Final Output Generation] (matches the refined JSON)\n{\"v\":1,\"round\":1993901,\"nonce\":\"c7de09202071958a\",\"action\":\"bet\",\"market\":\"PEPE\",\"side\":\"long\",\"margin_e6\":\"20000000\",\"leverage\":1}\nAll good. \n(Self-Correction/Verification during thought)\nWait, \"Amounts are US dollars times 1,000,000, so 10000000 is $10.\"\nThis means 1 e6 = $1.\nSo max_margin_e6: 2000000